WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:06.870
The groundwork of innovation and achievement
is ideas.

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:11.030
The ability to imagine something that does
not yet exist.

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:16.500
To create synergy between our thoughts and
the world.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.750
Unfortunately though, our ideas are not always
good.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:28.020
In general, it is more likely that the majority
of our ideas are bad.

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:34.480
But if hypothetically, let’s say one in
ten ideas are good, than the goal is to come

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:38.030
up with as many ideas as possible.

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:45.530
All it takes is one good idea, coupled with
proper execution, to ignite an explosion of

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:49.170
innovation and achievement.

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:56.691
In order to capture and execute the rare good
ideas swimming around inside your head, you

00:00:56.691 --> 00:01:01.559
must go through a process of idea collection.

00:01:01.559 --> 00:01:09.189
This involves collecting every idea that floats
to the surface of your consciousness.

00:01:09.189 --> 00:01:14.900
There is a sea of thought flowing beneath
your conscious perception filled with the

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:20.750
potential for powerful life-changing ideas.

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:28.490
Ideas float to the surface when they are facilitated
and inspired by new experiences, new understandings,

00:01:28.490 --> 00:01:32.460
and new perspectives.

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:40.950
To capitalize on this, you must grab every
idea that surfaces and bring it into shore.

00:01:40.950 --> 00:01:45.899
By simply writing your ideas down, you capture
them.

00:01:45.899 --> 00:01:52.720
But if not written down promptly after consciously
perceiving them, they will sink back into

00:01:52.720 --> 00:01:59.770
the subconscious and there is no guarantee
that they will re-surface.

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:06.460
Once you begin to gather your ideas on the
shoreline, the next and very important step

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:09.110
is evaluation.

00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:15.510
After letting your ideas dry off for a bit,
you must evaluate the validity and potential

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:16.510
of them.

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:23.030
You should trust in the potential of your
ideas but also thoroughly examine them with

00:02:23.030 --> 00:02:26.000
objectivity and reason.

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:33.690
If your ideas make it past this process, go
one further and test them out with carefully

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:39.470
selected friends, family members, and colleagues.

00:02:39.470 --> 00:02:45.310
Observe their reactions and open yourself
up to their feedback.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:53.090
Work to subtract your pride and ego from the
equation in order to absorb their feedback

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:56.730
fully and without resistance.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:03:04.540
Any stake of vanity that you hold within your
idea prevents clear and rational consideration

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:08.040
of its true potential.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:14.540
Once you have genuinely considered both your
own and other people’s evaluations and you

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:21.300
know in your heart of hearts that you have
synthesized an idea of great value, you will

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:24.270
become synchronized with its energy.

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:30.380
You will struggle to think of anything other
than the pursuit of its realization.

00:03:30.380 --> 00:03:35.440
At which point, you must execute the idea.

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:43.730
You must work to bring it into reality using
any infrastructure you have or can assemble.

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:49.930
Once you have made this decision to pursue
an idea into fruition, you must follow it

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:59.740
through without waver, for the greatest demise
of a good idea is indecision and uncertainty.

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:07.460
Employ the power of definitive effort towards
a good idea, and allow it to take its course.

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:29.270
If the idea is in fact a good one, it will
in time bring great abundance 

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:45.840
to that which it is designed to serve.

